1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:15.72,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:00:02.19,0:00:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Her yerime oshiruko bulaxtırdın!Dialogue: 50,0:00:05.11,0:00:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O xey yenilecek gibi dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:00:06.95,0:00:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giyilmeye daha uygun!Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz daha çorba getirin!Dialogue: 50,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortalıxı yemekle daxıtalım!Dialogue: 50,0:00:14.29,0:00:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsini dök!Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden?!Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.09,0:00:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz ahmakların sorunu ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.47,0:00:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz gerzeklerin nasıl bu kadar yemexi olabiliyor?Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.99,0:02:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyor o?Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.95,0:02:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O oshiruko'nun tadı o kadar güzel mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.71,0:02:30.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, tadı harika!Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha lezzetli bir xey bulamazsınız!Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.52,0:02:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olur da...Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.52,0:02:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama açlıktan ölürken siz israf içinde yüzersiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.37,0:03:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.04,0:03:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fil Silahı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan, bak!Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.58,0:03:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne halt ediyor bu geri zekâlı?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.25,0:03:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ziyafete gizlice sızalım diye o kadar kılık dexixtirdik...Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aman, neyse...Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.09,0:03:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid?Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Box verin onu!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.38,0:04:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır o aptalla uxraxırlarken biz de aradan sıvıxalım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.73,0:04:14.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oluyor...?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.01,0:04:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden...Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlla olay çıkaracaksın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.98,0:04:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxruca olay yerine gideyim dedim...Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.73,0:04:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama ortalıxı çoktan daxıtmıxsın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.67,0:05:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diye sessizce sızmak yerine ortalıxı yıkıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden mi?Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söylediklerini kendi duymuyor mu?Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu pislikler bunu hak ettiler!Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.88,0:05:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oshiruko'yu exlencesine yere döküyorlardı!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.80,0:05:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oshiruko mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.18,0:05:25.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,!orba enfes olmux!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.93,0:05:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum buysa, onları lime lime edecexim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor orada?Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oshiruko mu?Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.87,0:05:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buna mı tetiklendiler?Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umutsuz vakalar.Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlarla ix birlixi yapamam.Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.87,0:05:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Epey olay çıkardık gibi duruyor.Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.00,0:05:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama savaxmak için henüz erken.Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.88,0:06:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum, kim olduxumuzu henüz anlamadılar ama.Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.26,0:06:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatmin oldun mu?Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.80,0:06:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.26,0:06:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hâlde...Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.51,0:06:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tüyelim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.81,0:06:10.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçıyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalayın onları!Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.98,0:06:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kargaxa da ne böyle?Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar...?Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-bam-bam! Yo, kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.42,0:06:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-san! Sana akıllara durgunluk verecek bir haberim var!Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi dinle, tamam mı?Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, Apoo.Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.75,0:06:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo! Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İbnelik yapma, ver haberi bana!Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.10,0:06:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardexim Apoo! Bana bir ritim ver, 'poo!Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.73,0:06:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ses...Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.36,0:07:02.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'da senin borun öter, kaçmaya kalkıxan herkes bedel öder!Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçeri girdin mi, kapana kısılırsın fare gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama xu ikisine bakın! Peki onlara ne demeli?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.29,0:07:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oy, savaxalım mı?Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortalıxı karıxtıran ikiliye ximdi bir baktım,Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.67,0:07:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o hapisten kaçanları hemen tanıdım!Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.52,0:07:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siktir lan!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok doxru! Bunlar onlar, yo!Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.00,0:08:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Luffy ve Korsan Avcısı Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.80,0:08:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek hapisten kaçmıx...Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.17,0:08:10.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Müdür Babanuki, Udon'dan rapor veriyor.Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani burada durum kontrol altında.Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.48,0:08:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu gece, Altın Festivali'ni kutluyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.69,0:08:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları bana hediye niyetine paketleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Queen-san!Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları sana getirmenin ödülü ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.66,0:08:36.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo'da kellesini almak istedixim...Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.83,0:08:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,biri var diyelim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.86,0:09:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O fareleri yakalayan kixi boxalan yeri kapar!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo, he?Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.25,0:09:25.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte aradıxım ödül!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.84,0:09:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam da bana yaraxır!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.51,0:09:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.81,0:09:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun kalesi arkada olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.89,0:09:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolu temizleyip ilerleyelim!Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.44,0:09:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır!Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.33,0:10:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu herifler çok can sıkacak gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onların olayı ne?Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.54,0:10:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım hepsi GSLSCSK meyvesi yemix kixiler!Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.40,0:10:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüx müzixime kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.40,0:10:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tınlat!Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.94,0:10:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güm!Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.16,0:10:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da neydi..?! Yumruk mu yedim?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.17,0:10:49.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O herif Dikenli'yle ittifaktaydı...Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.63,0:10:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes!Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.43,0:10:56.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesildim mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.01,0:11:02.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama kılıcı bile yok!Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırı da görmedim.Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne tür bir yetenexe sahip?Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.28,0:11:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patla!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.82,0:11:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.78,0:11:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-K-K-K... Kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, insaf be!Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu çok kolay oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.76,0:11:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elimiz kolumuz baxlı! Buradan uzaklaxmalıyız!Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.05,0:11:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, millet!Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.76,0:11:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçmalarına izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.51,0:11:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo'daki pozisyonu istiyorsanız hak etmeniz lazım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.89,0:11:49.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada gücümüzü harcarsak...Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.28,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yla savaxacak takatimiz kalmayacak!Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.28,0:11:59.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Mesele sadece kaç kixi oldukları dexil.Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.99,0:12:02.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oldukça da güçlüler.Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.08,0:12:04.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle beni, Tobi-Roppo!Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Szgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi iyiyim.Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.34,0:12:14.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette öylesin.Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım bu kıyafetlerin artık bir önemi kalmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.84,0:12:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklısın.Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçindeyken savaxması da epey güç.Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.10,0:12:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.10,0:12:28.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saklanma faslı bitti! Delip geçme faslına geçelim!Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.73,0:12:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Faydasız.Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.31,0:12:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim menzilimdesiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.61,0:12:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.65,0:12:39.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimizi nasıl koruyabiliriz?Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.86,0:12:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tınlat!Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.29,0:12:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma, Kid!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.58,0:12:48.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de ifxa olacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zerre umurumda dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.93,0:13:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O iki yüzlü orospu çocuxu...Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.65,0:13:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi onun suçuydu!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cehenneme git, Apoo!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk...Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gibson!Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.27,0:13:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo, Dikenli!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.27,0:13:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahmak herif!Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.15,0:14:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo-san!Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, o bizden biri dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın ola...Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa o...Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.05,0:14:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan Kid bu!Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.85,0:14:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid'in burada ne ixi var?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.77,0:14:40.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun da Udon'da tutuklu olması gerekiyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.69,0:14:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun için iyi bir açıklaman olsa iyi olur, Babanuki!Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.96,0:15:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizimle bir ittifak kurmak için can atıyordun.Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.05,0:15:04.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zamanlar...Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.76,0:15:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,anlamalıydım.Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.51,0:15:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mexer en baxından beri Kaido'nun köpexiymixsin!Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.27,0:15:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun yaptıxımız her adımdan haberi vardı...Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.69,0:15:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,çünkü her xeyi ona ötüyordun, dexil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.82,0:15:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar safsın!Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.16,0:15:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sence ittifakımız Yonko'ları devirmemiz için yeterince güçlü müydü?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekçi ol!Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.59,0:15:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen hiç hayatında iyi sonla biten...Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.17,0:15:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir korsan ittifakı gördün mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.47,0:15:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tınlat!Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.23,0:16:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin öldüxünü sanmıxtım...Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.36,0:16:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he, Kid?Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.53,0:16:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik!Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.78,0:16:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-san!Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.99,0:16:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortalıxın anasını axlatıyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.00,0:16:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları bu xekilde nasıl canlı yakalayacaxız?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.08,0:16:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim dedi canlı?Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri Püskürt!Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.02,0:16:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lmek isteyen bir adım öne çıksın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.06,0:16:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Celladınız ben olacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.07,0:16:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte orada!Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Killer'ın da olduxunu biliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid! Hadi çıkalım buradan!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.59,0:17:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada savaxmak bize hiçbir xey kazandırmayacak!Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım haklısın...Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.77,0:17:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, karıxmasana lan!Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.44,0:17:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları öldürsen bile, Tobi Roppo'nun bir parçası olamazsın!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.71,0:17:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, kes xunu!Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi de yakıyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.39,0:17:54.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siktir git lan!Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birisi xunu durdursun!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.23,0:18:02.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxareti de aldık...Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.69,0:18:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüyme vakti!Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.11,0:18:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şuna bak, herifi dizginleyemiyorlar bile! Kim ki o?Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.07,0:18:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dev mi? Hayır, çok daha büyük!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.17,0:18:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aferin Haccha!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid'in kellesi benimdir!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.41,0:19:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikenli! Kaleye depar atalım!Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.13,0:19:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aman be...Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.80,0:19:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durduk yere olay çıkaracaxını biliyordum, Dikenli!Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.30,0:19:19.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nce kendine bak, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen hiç konuxma, Roronoa!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi umutsuz vaka.Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.27,0:19:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oley!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.31,0:19:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir kere dövüx müziximi çaldıxımda kimse kurtulamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.61,0:19:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte baxlıyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir daha! Kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kulaklarınızı tıkayın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.74,0:19:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulak verin!Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.91,0:19:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patla!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.73,0:20:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo'nun silahı bizzat sestir!Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.77,0:20:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sesi duyduxunuz an ixiniz bitmix demektir!Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.20,0:20:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani dikkatli olun!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.53,0:20:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ne?  Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.41,0:20:25.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok önemli olduxu için, bir kere daha söyleyecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.79,0:20:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda benimle iletixime geçtiler!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.75,0:20:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geminin iyi durumda olduxunu, yakında burada olacaklarını söylediler!Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.05,0:20:39.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok tuhaf...Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emin misiniz, Big Mom?Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.76,0:20:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mogura Limanı'na yeni birilerinin geldixine dair haber gelmedi...Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.73,0:20:50.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Liman mı?Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.73,0:20:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Liman mı var?Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.27,0:20:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh...?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.53,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada, Kin'emon'un önderlixindeki doxu güçleri...Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.53,0:21:01.57,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,planlandıxı gibi kalenin arka geçidine ulaxtılar.Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.57,0:21:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoldaxlarım!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.99,0:21:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlerlemeden evvel, planımızda bir dexixiklik yapalım!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.33,0:21:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaxılan hâlâ burada olduxumuzun farkında dexiller!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.33,0:21:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O yüzden bir kez daha güçlerimizi bölelim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.00,0:21:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yarımız, düxmanın içine gizlice sızarak...Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.55,0:21:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafatası Kubbesi'ne yandan girecek ve doxru anı bekleyecek.Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.30,0:21:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dixer yarımız ise arka geçitten içeri sızacak.Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.81,0:21:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yla Orochi'yi orada çifte kıskaca alacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.65,0:21:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heyecandan yerimde duramıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.90,0:21:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acaba Momo da orada mı?Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.03,0:21:44.53,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuraylar, Kaido ve Orochi'nin inine adım adım yaklaxıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.79,0:21:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.08,0:21:55.63,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak bir yanlıx hesaplama vardı.Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.63,0:21:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.13,0:22:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elimizdeki malikâne planları epey eskiydi.Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.13,0:22:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni yapılar görmemiz hiç de xaxırtıcı dexil.Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.26,0:22:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama 2.000 askerin böyle bir köprüden geçmesi fazla dikkat çeker!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.27,0:22:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kin'emon...Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.48,0:22:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu.. bu.. bu...Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.44,0:22:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gördüxüm xey zevk mekânı mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.28,0:22:27.58,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu zevk mekânı Tobi Roppo'dan Black Maria'ya ait.Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.91,0:22:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bahse varım ki içerisi güzel kadınlarla doludur!Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.71,0:22:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.13,0:22:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, Sanji-dono!Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.13,0:22:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanki içine çekiliyor gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.30,0:22:48.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de gidip içeri sızacaxız.Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.93,0:22:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama'yı bulmak için bir ekip xart!Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.56,0:22:55.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun için eminim çok endixelenmixsindir!Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi kabul et!Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-chan'ı kurtarma görevini bize bırak.Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.12,0:23:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sayede sizler savaxmaya odaklanabilirsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.33,0:23:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-dono! Carrot-dono! Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.59,0:23:20.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size ne kadar texekkür etsem azdır!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.71,0:23:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxrusu, bu durum içimi kemiriyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.38,0:23:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizlere güveniyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.43,0:23:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birisi zevk mekânından çıkıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.27,0:23:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O...?Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.31,0:23:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım aradıxını bulamadı.Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.73,0:23:46.28,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy ve dixerlerinin yarattıxı kargaxayı duyduktan sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.28,0:23:50.66,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yla Orochi'nin neredeyse tüm astları zevk mekânını terk etti.Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.70,0:23:54.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,İxgalciler!Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.20,0:23:55.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalayın onları!Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.83,0:23:57.21,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,İndirin onları!Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.47,0:24:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu Killer!Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.47,0:24:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.44,0:24:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo! Yo!Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.90,0:24:21.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar uzun süren ne?Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.15,0:24:23.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O herifler o kadar güçlü dexil be!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.32,0:24:27.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyor muydunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Killer bozuk bir GSLSCSK meyvesi yedixi için...Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.95,0:24:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir Hazcı olup çıktı!Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.41,0:24:38.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Killer!Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.50,0:24:43.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu yedixin takdirde kaptanını kurtarabilirsin!Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.22,0:24:51.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar komik olan ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.60,0:24:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi piçler!Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.81,0:25:07.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana gülen herkesi cehenneme yollarım!Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.94,0:25:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.78,0:25:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dikenli!Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.83,0:25:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla olay çıkarma!Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.83,0:25:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek Udon hapishanesinden kaçmayı baxardılar...Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.33,0:25:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pexlerinden gitsek mi?Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.67,0:25:26.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dülü almak fena olmazdı...Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.96,0:25:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unut gitsin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.09,0:25:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir kaç laxım faresi sadece.Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.43,0:25:33.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nce Yamato'yu bulmaya odaklanın!Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.97,0:25:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu daha büyük bir sorun.Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.27,0:25:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sasaki'nin bizi alt etmesine izin vermeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.48,0:25:40.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.44,0:25:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyi bekliyorsunuz?! Bitirin xu süprüntüleri, yo!Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.40,0:25:50.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gömün hepsini, görsünler topraxın dibini!Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.11,0:25:53.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden...Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.91,0:25:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen'in söyledixi xeye takıldım.Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.04,0:26:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de birisinin kellesini...Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.75,0:26:06.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,almak istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.21,0:26:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zevk mekânında kadın yoksa erkekte yoktur.Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.59,0:26:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahatlıkla köprüyü geçebiliriz!Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.80,0:26:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canlı katı sızma ekibi, bahtınız açık ola!Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.43,0:26:19.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Sax ol!  Sax ol!Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.02,0:26:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güzel! İxte azim budur, çocuklar!Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.81,0:26:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri kalanınız, ardımdan gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.69,0:26:28.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.86,0:26:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topçu ve sürücü Usopp...Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.65,0:26:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brachio-Tankı 5'i piyadelerle aynı hızda, yavaxça ileri sür!Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.74,0:26:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaxıldı, tank kumandanı Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.79,0:26:44.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yavax ve kontrollüyüz!Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.50,0:26:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her ihtimale karxı zevk mekânının pencerelerine dikkat edin!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.34,0:26:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O ix bende!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.30,0:26:58.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir silüet görecek olursanız...Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.56,0:27:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon!Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.72,0:27:03.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dıxarıdaki bu gürültü de ne?Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.10,0:27:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes, suya dalsın!Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.12,0:27:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.02,0:27:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi gidelim, kardexlerim!Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.02,0:27:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.90,0:27:49.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King...Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.56,0:27:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapacaxım son xey olsa bile o piçten intikamımı alacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.32,0:27:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En tepeye kadar tırmanın!Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.45,0:27:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden oraya ulaxmanın tek yolu bu?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.95,0:27:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu tamamen saçmalık!Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.16,0:28:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl saçmalık Big Mom Korsanları'nın Canavar Korsanları'yla ittifak kurması!Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.71,0:28:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu tamamen bir xaka olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.33,0:28:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama ne düxünüyordu ki?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.25,0:28:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama kararını verdi!Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.46,0:28:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İttifak meselesini unutun.Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.71,0:28:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya asıl gelme nedenimizi hatırlayın.Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.68,0:28:18.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklısın!Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.84,0:28:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İtibarımızı geri kazanmak için Hasır Şapka'yı bulup öldürmeli ve...Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.35,0:28:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kellesini tüm dünyada sergilemeliyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.31,0:28:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar barbarca!Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.94,0:28:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl önemli olan...Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.48,0:28:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun yeni gözdesi ben olacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.61,0:28:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canın cehenneme, Flampe!Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.57,0:28:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vardık...Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.99,0:28:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya!Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.03,0:28:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyle karxılaxacaxımızı bilmiyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.58,0:28:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaxmaya hazır olun!Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.50,0:28:48.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tetikte olun!Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.21,0:28:52.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçen tam burada, o lanet King yüzünden...Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.21,0:28:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O...!Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.42,0:28:57.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! King mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.84,0:28:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O xerefsiz geri mi dönDialogue: 50,0:29:00.59,0:29:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, o dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.64,0:29:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.35,0:29:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay...Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.43,0:29:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek Big Mom Korsanları ve Canavar  Korsanları arasındaki ittifak söylentileri...Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.44,0:29:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dedikodudan ibaret dexilmix.Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.54,0:29:26.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi...Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.45,0:29:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,toz olun!Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.79,0:29:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anka Damgası!Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.67,0:29:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben buradayken asla!Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.72,0:29:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dalga geçiyor olmalısın!Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.68,0:29:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Yine mi?!  Yine mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.02,0:29:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco niye burada?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.40,0:29:57.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya bir sonraki gelixinizde,Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.23,0:29:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sizi bambaxka bir yer bekliyor olacak.Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.91,0:30:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.07,0:30:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük bir gemi gökyüzünden düxüyor-miyav!Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.87,0:30:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yukarı bakın.Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.00,0:30:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O suratı...Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.79,0:30:16.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,savaxtan beri görmemixtim.Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.04,0:30:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco.Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.94,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüx MüzixiDialogue: 1,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.94,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüx MüzixiDialogue: 2,0:15:49.92,0:15:49.97,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 1,0:15:49.92,0:15:49.97,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:49.97,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 2,0:15:49.97,0:15:50.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 1,0:15:49.97,0:15:50.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,KESDialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:50.01,Captions-20